5. Conveying Modified Source Versions.

You may convey a work based on the Program, or the modifications to
produce it from the Program, in the form of source code under the
terms of section 4, provided that you also meet all of these conditions:

a) The work must carry prominent notices stating that you modified
it, and giving a relevant date.

b) The work must carry prominent notices stating that it is
released under this License and any conditions imposed under section
7. This notice modifies the requirement in section 4 to "keep intact
all notices".

c) You must license the entire work, as a whole, under this
License, to anyone who comes into possession of any copy. This
License will therefore apply, with any modifications allowed by this
License, to the whole work, and thus to all its parts, regardless
of how they are packaged. This License applies to the whole work
