"Additional permissions" are terms that supplement the terms of this
License by making exceptions from one or more of its conditions.
Additional permissions that are applicable to the entire Program may
be given by the copyright holder. When an additional permission
applies only to a specific part of the Program, it applies to that
part, and the License applies to the rest of the Program.

When you convey a copy of a covered work, you may at your option
remove any additional permissions from that copy, or from any
